 [32m✓[39m src/client/client.rest.test.ts [2m([22m[2m47 tests[22m[2m)[22m[33m 14174[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m registers one Client and reuses its shared identity across two active Companies [33m 392[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m orders active-Company Clients deterministically and bounds Workspace search [33m 434[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m replays registration safely and rejects an idempotency key with changed intent [33m 379[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m combines a Company Director Client grant with Company management permissions [33m 322[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m keeps legacy client.manage on the minimal interface until the Owner has a Director grant [33m 355[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m denies Client access without the dedicated permission and without leaking metadata [33m 306[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m collapses concurrent attachment into one relationship and one event [33m 336[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m grants a narrow Company Director bundle for enriched Client create and read, then revokes it immediately [33m 340[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m shows involved provider names and records one attributable correction with optimistic concurrency [33m 349[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m queues corrections that both reserved a receipt before either locked the Client [33m 321[2mms[22m[39m
     [33m[2m✓[22m[39m replays a same-key correction that waited on the reserved receipt and refuses changed intent [33m 325[2mms[22m[39m
